#   then latched as failed like a refusal: the compiler service that dies on one shader dies on it again, and every retry was a synchronous compile on the submit thread plus a [RED] line
#   at every dispatch. Logged at each of the first three and at the latch only. t_dispatch_pipeline: 10 checks, 0 failed (two interruptions leave it retryable, the third latches it:
#   8 more dispatches compile nothing); the first case (one interruption, then the next dispatch builds the pipeline) still holds.
